WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.309
Blend sounds into syllables, then join syllables to read a longer word. Check the

00:00:05.309 --> 00:00:07.133
word's meaning and conventional spelling.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.150
Which word begins with the digraph sh? Answer: ship

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.366
Break six two-syllable words into their component syllables and blend them again.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.253
Why it works: The letters sh represent a single consonant sound.
